City names and time zones
  crates/engine/data/cities.tsv is derived from the GeoNames cities15000
  dump (https://www.geonames.org), licensed under Creative Commons
  Attribution 4.0 International (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
  Changes: names lowercased, alternate names kept only for large cities, the
  most populous city kept for each name, and time zones replaced by indexes
  into a zone list. The file is built by tools/gen_cities.py and is compiled
  into the napkin binary.
